<title>INDIA: India RBI raises 29.2 bln rupees in 14-day t-bills.</title>
<headline>India RBI raises 29.2 bln rupees in 14-day t-bills.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India on Friday said it accepted bids for 29.20 billion rupees at its weekly auction of 14-day treasury bills.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
